---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="PairPilot Radar Early Access"
  description="Join the PairPilot Radar early-access waitlist and help shape the next stage of PairPilotFX decision support."
  canonicalPath="/early-access/"
>
  <main data-early-access>
    <section class="early-hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <div class="pill"><span class="status-dot"></span> Radar early-access waitlist</div>
          <p class="eyebrow">PairPilot Radar</p>
          <h1>Help shape the product before public release.</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            Join the Radar early-access waitlist if you want to test a structured market-selection and
            preparation workflow built around Context, Strength, Structure, Liquidity, Confirmation, and Risk.
          </p>
          <div class="expectation-list">
            <div><span>01</span><p><strong>Not automatic access.</strong> The waitlist helps PairPilotFX identify a small group of suitable Phase 7 testers.</p></div>
            <div><span>02</span><p><strong>No signal service.</strong> Radar is designed to support judgment and watchlist selection—not generate BUY/SELL commands.</p></div>
            <div><span>03</span><p><strong>Feedback matters.</strong> Early testers may be asked what is useful, confusing, missing, or worth returning for.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="fit-card card" aria-label="Radar early-access tester profile">
          <span class="card-kicker">EARLY-ACCESS FOCUS</span>
          <h2>We are looking for traders who care about the process before the entry.</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>multi-timeframe market preparation;</li>
            <li>relative-strength and pair selection;</li>
            <li>structure and liquidity context;</li>
            <li>clear confirmation and invalidation;</li>
            <li>reducing unnecessary chart scanning.</li>
          </ul>
          <a
            href="/radar/"
            data-analytics-event="radar_cta_click"
            data-analytics-placement="early_access_fit_card"
          >Review the Radar product model →</a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container"><div class="rule"></div></div>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container form-grid">
        <div class="form-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">Join the waitlist</p>
          <h2>A few details will help us choose useful testers later.</h2>
          <p class="lead">
            Email is required so PairPilotFX can contact you about Radar early access. Everything else is
            optional and is used only to understand tester fit and product needs.
          </p>

          <div class="privacy-note card">
            <strong>Privacy boundary</strong>
            <p>
              Waitlist form details are submitted separately from the private PairPilotFX automation backend.
              Email addresses and free-text answers are not included in website analytics events.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-card card">
          <p class="returning-note" data-waitlist-returning hidden>
            This browser previously submitted the Radar waitlist. You can submit again if you want to update your details.
          </p>

          <form
            action="https://formsubmit.co/pairpilotfx@gmail.com"
            method="POST"
            data-waitlist-form
          >
            <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="PairPilot Radar early access signup" />
            <input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table" />
            <input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false" />
            <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://pairpilotfx.com/early-access/thanks/?submitted=1" />
            <input class="honey" type="text" name="_honey" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" />

            <div class="field-row">
              <label>
                <span>First name <em>optional</em></span>
                <input type="text" name="first_name" maxlength="60" autocomplete="given-name" />
              </label>
              <label>
                <span>Email <strong>required</strong></span>
                <input type="email" name="email" maxlength="160" autocomplete="email" required />
              </label>
            </div>

            <label>
              <span>Trading experience <em>optional</em></span>
              <select name="experience">
                <option value="">Prefer not to say</option>
                <option value="less_than_1_year">Less than 1 year</option>
                <option value="1_to_3_years">1–3 years</option>
                <option value="3_to_5_years">3–5 years</option>
                <option value="5_plus_years">5+ years</option>
              </select>
            </label>

            <fieldset class="pair-fieldset">
              <legend>Markets you regularly watch <em>optional</em></legend>
              <div class="pair-options">
                <label><input type="checkbox" name="pairs" value="AUD/USD" /><span>AUD/USD</span></label>
                <label><input type="checkbox" name="pairs" value="NZD/USD" /><span>NZD/USD</span></label>
                <label><input type="checkbox" name="pairs" value="AUD/CAD" /><span>AUD/CAD</span></label>
                <label><input type="checkbox" name="pairs" value="NZD/CAD" /><span>NZD/CAD</span></label>
                <label><input type="checkbox" name="pairs" value="XAU/USD" /><span>XAU/USD</span></label>
                <label><input type="checkbox" name="pairs" value="Other FX" /><span>Other FX</span></label>
              </div>
            </fieldset>

            <label>
              <span>What is the biggest problem with your current scanning or preparation process? <em>optional</em></span>
              <textarea
                name="scanning_problem"
                rows="4"
                maxlength="1000"
                placeholder="Example: I spend too much time scanning pairs that never become actionable."
              ></textarea>
            </label>

            <label>
              <span>What would you most want Radar to help you do? <em>optional</em></span>
              <textarea
                name="desired_help"
                rows="4"
                maxlength="1000"
                placeholder="Example: Narrow my watchlist and show me what condition is still missing."
              ></textarea>
            </label>

            <label class="consent">
              <input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="yes" required />
              <span>
                I agree that PairPilotFX may use the information I submit to manage the Radar early-access
                waitlist and contact me about Radar testing. I understand that joining does not guarantee access.
              </span>
            </label>

            <div class="submit-row">
              <button class="button" type="submit" data-waitlist-submit>Join Radar Early Access →</button>
              <span class="submit-status" data-waitlist-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></span>
            </div>

            <p class="form-footnote">
              By submitting, you acknowledge the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>. Radar remains a developing
              educational decision-support product and does not provide individualized investment advice or trade signals.
            </p>
          </form>

          <div class="success-panel" data-waitlist-success hidden>
            <span class="success-mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
            <p class="eyebrow">Waitlist received</p>
            <h2>You're on the Radar early-access list.</h2>
            <p>
              PairPilotFX will use this list when selecting a small group of testers for the next product phase.
              Joining the waitlist does not guarantee an invitation.
            </p>
            <div class="button-row">
              <a
                class="button"
                href="/weekly/"
                data-analytics-event="weekly_brief_cta_click"
                data-analytics-placement="early_access_success"
              >Follow the Weekly FX Brief →</a>
              <a
                class="button button-secondary"
                href="/tools/trade-preparation-checklist/"
                data-analytics-event="free_tool_cta_click"
                data-analytics-placement="early_access_success"
              >Use the free checklist</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-tight">
      <div class="container what-next card">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">What happens next</p>
          <h2>Waitlist first. Small tester group second.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="steps">
          <div><span>01</span><p><strong>Join the list.</strong> Tell us enough to understand how you currently prepare for trades.</p></div>
          <div><span>02</span><p><strong>PairPilotFX reviews fit.</strong> Tester selection will consider product needs, capacity, and useful variation in experience.</p></div>
          <div><span>03</span><p><strong>Selected testers are contacted.</strong> Invitations and testing instructions will be sent separately when the private alpha is ready.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container disclaimer">
      <strong>Risk note</strong>
      <p>
        Joining the Radar early-access waitlist does not create an advisory relationship, guarantee access,
        or imply that any market scenario will result in a trade or profitable outcome.
      </p>
    </section>

    <script>
      import '../../scripts/earlyAccess';
    </script>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .early-hero { padding: 104px 0 82px; }
  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.07fr) minmax(360px, .93fr);
    gap: 58px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .hero-copy { display: grid; gap: 22px; }
  .hero-copy h1 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 6.8vw, 5.8rem); }
  .status-dot {
    width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #7ee2b8;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(126,226,184,.08);
  }
  .expectation-list { display: grid; gap: 14px; margin-top: 8px; }
  .expectation-list > div {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr; gap: 10px; align-items: start;
    color: var(--muted); font-size: .86rem;
  }
  .expectation-list > div > span {
    color: #587691; font: 750 .71rem/1.7 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
  }
  .expectation-list strong { color: #d9e8f6; }

  .fit-card { display: grid; gap: 18px; padding: clamp(26px, 4vw, 40px); border-color: var(--border-strong); }
  .fit-card h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 3rem); }
  .fit-card ul { display: grid; gap: 10px; margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; color: #b9cadd; }
  .fit-card a { color: var(--accent-strong); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 750; font-size: .9rem; }
  .fit-card a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .card-kicker { color: #668199; font-size: .67rem; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: .13em; }

  .form-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: .72fr 1.28fr;
    gap: 52px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .form-copy { display: grid; gap: 18px; position: sticky; top: 104px; }
  .privacy-note { display: grid; gap: 8px; padding: 20px; margin-top: 10px; }
  .privacy-note strong { color: #dcecff; }
  .privacy-note p { color: var(--muted); font-size: .82rem; }

  .form-card { padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 40px); border-color: var(--border-strong); }
  form { display: grid; gap: 22px; }
  .field-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr; gap: 18px; }
  form > label, .field-row label { display: grid; gap: 8px; color: #b7c9da; font-size: .83rem; font-weight: 700; }
  label span em, legend em { color: #728ba3; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; }
  label span strong { color: #8fc7ff; font-size: .72rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  input[type="text"], input[type="email"], select, textarea {
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgba(4,13,23,.72);
    color: #edf6ff;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    outline: none;
  }
  input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus {
    border-color: var(--accent-strong);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(88,166,255,.08);
  }
  textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 110px; }
  select { appearance: auto; }

  .pair-fieldset { display: grid; gap: 11px; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; }
  .pair-fieldset legend { color: #b7c9da; font-size: .83rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .pair-options { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  .pair-options label { cursor: pointer; }
  .pair-options input { position: absolute; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }
  .pair-options span {
    display: inline-flex; padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 999px;
    color: #9db2c7; background: rgba(255,255,255,.025); font-size: .76rem; font-weight: 750;
  }
  .pair-options input:checked + span {
    color: #cfe8ff; border-color: rgba(88,166,255,.45); background: rgba(88,166,255,.11);
  }
  .pair-options input:focus-visible + span { outline: 2px solid var(--accent-strong); outline-offset: 2px; }

  .consent {
    display: grid !important;
    grid-template-columns: 20px 1fr;
    gap: 10px !important;
    align-items: start;
    color: var(--muted) !important;
    font-size: .78rem !important;
    font-weight: 500 !important;
  }
  .consent input { margin: 4px 0 0; accent-color: var(--accent); }
  .submit-row { display: grid; gap: 12px; justify-items: start; }
  .submit-row .button { border: 0; cursor: pointer; }
  .submit-row .button:disabled { cursor: wait; opacity: .7; transform: none; }
  .submit-status { min-height: 20px; color: #91a8bf; font-size: .8rem; }
  .submit-status[data-state="error"] { color: #ffb4aa; }
  .form-footnote { color: #71899f; font-size: .74rem; line-height: 1.55; }
  .form-footnote a { color: #9fcfff; }
  .returning-note {
    margin-bottom: 22px; padding: 12px 14px; border: 1px solid rgba(126,226,184,.24);
    border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(126,226,184,.06); color: #b9ddce; font-size: .8rem;
  }
  .honey { position: absolute !important; left: -9999px !important; width: 1px !important; height: 1px !important; }

  .success-panel { display: grid; gap: 18px; }
  .success-mark {
    display: inline-grid; place-items: center; width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(126,226,184,.10); border: 1px solid rgba(126,226,184,.35); color: #7ee2b8;
    font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 900;
  }
  .success-panel > p:not(.eyebrow) { color: var(--muted); }
  .success-panel .button-row { margin-top: 8px; }

  .what-next {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: .75fr 1.25fr;
    gap: 50px;
    padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 54px);
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
  }
  .what-next > div:first-child { display: grid; gap: 14px; align-content: start; }
  .steps { display: grid; }
  .steps > div {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 36px 1fr; gap: 12px;
    padding: 17px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
  }
  .steps > div:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .steps span { color: #5b7691; font: 750 .71rem/1.7 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .steps p { color: var(--muted); font-size: .84rem; }
  .steps strong { color: #dcecff; }

  .disclaimer {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 20px;
    padding-top: 0; padding-bottom: 72px; color: #7890a8; font-size: .78rem;
  }
  .disclaimer strong { color: #9ab1c7; white-space: nowrap; }

  @media (max-width: 920px) {
    .early-hero { padding-top: 78px; }
    .hero-grid, .form-grid, .what-next { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .form-copy { position: static; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .field-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .disclaimer { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 7px; }
  }
</style>
